Package: knowledge
Title: Watershed-Group Fisheries Background
Version: 0.4.2
Date: 2026-10-17
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("New Graph Environment Ltd.", role = "cph"))
Description: Functions for assembling fisheries background per watershed group:
    pulling provincial PSCIS crossing layers clipped to a group, deriving the
    past-report and crossing tables from them, and checking GNIS stream names
    for cross-group collisions before searching by name, reading the
    life-history timing table by group and species, and reading the cited
    literature evidence for habitat variables by species, and reading the
    registry of intrinsic-potential habitat models that evidence links to.
